{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22108","headline":"松斋自题 · 白居易","name":"松斋自题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非老亦非少，年过三纪余。\n非贱亦非贵，朝登一命初。\n才小分易足，心宽体长舒。\n充肠皆美食，容膝即安居。\n况此松斋下，一琴数帙书。\n书不求甚解，琴聊以自娱。\n夜直入君门，晚归卧吾庐。\n形骸委顺动，方寸付空虚。\n持此将过日，自然多晏如。\n昏昏复默默，非智亦非愚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}